    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Karl, <div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve got 3 more questions.</div><div><br></div><div>1. Is there a way to generate a heat map of chromosome interactions in RQTL2?</div><div><br></div><div>2. Is the kinship matrix recommended for analysis of an F2 population? Or is this more suited for RILs like the Collaborative Cross?</div><div><br></div><div>3. I noticed that the legends for QTL effect plots depend on the order that the alleles are listed in the yaml file. I want to confirm that I&#39;ve listed mine in the correct order. In my yaml I have this information:</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">alleles:</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">- B</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">- F</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">genotypes:</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">  B: 1</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">  H: 2</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">  F: 3</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\"><br></span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"> But I noticed that if I change it to:</span><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">alleles:</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">- F</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">- B</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">genotypes:</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">  B: 1</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">  H: 2</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">  F: 3</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"> Then the legend on the effect plots changes. I&#39;m assuming the first version is the ~correct~ assignment but I want to be sure!<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri;font-size:12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\">Thanks so much for your time!</p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\">Best,</p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\">Anna</p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;word-break:normal\"><br></p></div></div>"
