    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Use of a linear mixed model with a polygenic effect for background QTL is potentially useful in an F2 and not just in populations with some structure. But the &quot;best&quot; analysis likely depends on the (unknown) genetic architecture of the trait.<br></div></div>"
    ],
