tr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\"><br></span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"> But I noticed that if I change it to:</span><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">alleles:</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">- F</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">- B</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">genotypes:</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">  B: 1</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri\">  H: 2</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:1